# Formal test and plan boundaries
# Functional test scripts under tests/ and packages/*/tests/ are reviewable assets
# and must remain version-controlled; only caches and Skill-local legacy fixtures
# are ignored. Formal plans belong under docs/plans/.
!/tests/
!/tests/**
!/packages/**/tests/
!/packages/**/tests/**
tests/**/__pycache__/
!/tests/**/*.py
packages/**/tests/**/__pycache__/
skills/*/tests/
skills/*/plans/
.git-pr-review/
.bensz-api/
reviews/

# macOS metadata must remain ignored even inside explicitly reviewable test trees
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Icon
Icon?
docs/reviews/